            </note>
            <note corresp="#d276-f2" n="2" xml:id="d276-f2-content">
                <p>For text of this amendment to P.L. 96-90, the Defense Appropriations Act of 1968,
                    approved September 29, 1967, see 81 Stat. 238.</p>
            </note>
